{100}{}{Paladin}
{200}{}{You see a Brotherhood Paladin.}
{210}{}{You see a Paladin of the Brotherhood of Steel.}
{240}{}{You see a dead Brotherhood Paladin.}
{260}{}{You see a slain Brotherhood Paladin.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{Answer text}
{1020}{}{Not ugly. Quest in progress.}
{1030}{}{Not ugly. Quest completed.}
{1040}{}{Not ugly. Quest not started.}
{2000}{}{There's no way in hell we initiated anyone as ugly as you. Get out of here.}
{3000}{}{You interested in helping out the Brotherhood @sex@|boy||girl|?}
{3010}{}{Yes sir! Here to serve the Brotherhood.}
{3020}{}{Nope. I'm just here for the title.}
{3030}{}{Could you train me in close combat techniques, sir?}
{4000}{}{For a grunt like you, you get exactly what you deserve, grunt work. And you gotta be one lucky @sex@|son of a bitch||whining bitch| today! You know why?}
{4010}{}{May I guess, sir?}
{4020}{}{No, sir!}
{5000}{}{Why do we keep scum like you around? Get the hell out of my sight!}
{6000}{}{Because there's no work that dirty that I may assign to such a worthless rat like you! Get out!}
{7000}{}{** OLD ** Good job. There's still work to be done so quit standing around!}
{8000}{}{** OLD ** I don't have anything for you to do. Quit bothering me.}
{9000}{}{** OLD ** Dummy node}
{10000}{}{** OLD ** Well?}
{10010}{}{I'm finished, sir!}
{10020}{}{I'll get back to work...}
{11000}{}{** OLD ** Can't even finish the whole thing....Damn right you're getting back to work. And stop being so useless!}
{12000}{}{Stand still, let me show you proper close-quarters technique. Ready to learn?}
{12010}{}{Yes, teach me everything you know, sir.}
{12020}{}{Never mind, I'll pass.}
{13000}{}{There, your close combat form is sharper now. Don't waste it.}
{13010}{}{Thank you, sir. I won't.}